# Searchable catalog kinds

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-searchable-kind/SKILL.md`.
Behavior: `docs/deployment-plan/spike-3/omnibar-search.md`.

- Register kinds in `core/search` (weights, context sections, location mapper).
- Project documents via `core/database/searchindex`; reproject on writes; heal with `searchindex.EnsureCatalog`.
- Do not put ad hoc SQL/`LIKE` search in FFI handlers or a permanent Swift engine.
- Hits must include a navigable `WorkspaceLocation` (section + deep id).
- Empty / whitespace queries return no hits; FakeStore mirrors Go kind rules and marks the catalog session held.
- CGO builds require `-tags fts5`.
